<!--
  Growth metric: Head — a head with one curl.

  A circumference is a measurement OF a head, so the icon is the head rather than a tape measure. The
  curl is what makes it an infant's head and not a circle: without it this is indistinguishable from the
  Pebbles consistency glyph at 16dp.
-->
